---
// Small red pill used everywhere a scheduled session might need to show
// its sold-out state — matches the existing red "Inactive"/"Expired"
// label convention already used in the admin dashboard.
---

<span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] bg-de-red/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[length:var(--text-caption)] font-semibold text-de-red">
  Sold out
</span>
